+# Lane C independent N19 review
+
+Disposition: PASS_BOUNDED_NATIVE_ENGINEERING for the isolated V6 runtime and V3 supervisor copied from RECOVERY_20260915_B_PROCESS_GAPS. This closes the exercised local runtime-boundary engineering lane. It grants no learner authority, admission, scientific exposure, successor promotion, or full R33/N17 qualification. BUILD_08 remains rejected historical evidence; neither that packet nor global STATUS.json was repinned.
+
+Inspected B's adversarial review and command scripts, B_INDEPENDENT's review, PROCESS_GAPS's review, integrated scripts and actual native sources/imports, and the restored six C sources. Historical receipts served only to locate candidates and identify claims. Every qualification executable here was freshly built with /Users/Shared/micah/Documents/zag/znc, macos-arm64, --no-zagd --no-analyze --no-foreground-cache. Shell/Perl handled orchestration and source/script preparation; shasum hashed raw files. No Python, PyTorch, NumPy, pickle loading, foreign ML runtime, historical verifier, or historical executable was run. The canonical serialized file was hashed as opaque bytes only.
