+Final qualification is final_run.zsh, exit 0, final.summary.txt: failures=0 commands=93. Logs 201–293 individually capture exact escaped argv, stdout, stderr and exit. Final roots c/d are freshly created, separate from initial roots a/b and all earlier lanes. Additional independent native build and two fresh-root tests are logs 101–103, all exit 0. These 96 commands are the final qualification basis; all logs and scripts are hashed. Earlier successful rounds remain supplementary evidence.
