+| --- | --- |
+| Descriptor custody | logs 211/254 host assertions all pass. Retained live-root fd writes before rename and after replacement; held and moved descriptors read exact original bytes; replacement directory lacks both leaves. Leaf operations borrow the retained root and do not reopen it by pathname. |
